#compdef core-status
# Completion for Core's `core-status` (zsh/30-functions.zsh). It renders the provenance
# panel — Core version + what core.lock records, the live OS/role layers, a tool summary
# and whether core/ has been edited since it was committed. --json emits the same facts as
# one object for a statusline or a gate to consume.
_arguments -s \
  '(-h --help)'{-h,--help}'[show usage and exit]' \
  '--json[machine-readable status object on stdout]'
